      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00148",
        "explanation": "The patient confirmed that the appointment and work leave were secured.",
        "quote": "后天上午那个感染科/肝病方向普通号约上了"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00154",
        "explanation": "The final safety net remained limited and did not include gastrointestinal bleeding or several other required danger signals.",
        "quote": "眼睛或皮肤发黄、小便变成浓茶色、恶心呕吐吃不下东西、肚子突然胀大，或者累到完全起不来床"
      }
    ],
